B.aYx=new A.jA("1. Platform Overview & Scope","FoodGo operates an online food ordering, restaurant partner management, and real-time courier dispatch platform in the Kingdom of Cambodia. By accessing or placing orders through FoodGo, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.",B.aF,B.aL1,B.xf)
B.aHg=s(["One primary account per customer mobile number (+855).","Role-based access for Customer, Restaurant Partner, Driver Courier, and Platform Admin.","Immediate suspension for fraudulent orders or unauthorized API usage."],t.s)
B.alY=new A.V(62589,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aYt=new A.jA("2. Account Registration & Phone Verification","Users must provide accurate contact information, including a valid Cambodia mobile number (+855) or verified email address. You are responsible for safeguarding your account credentials and OTP verification codes.",B.aHg,B.df,B.alY)
B.aHJ=s(["Dynamic KHQR codes include EMVCo Tag 99 creation/expiration timestamps for bank compliance.","Orders cannot be cancelled without charge once the partner restaurant has begun preparing the food.","Missing or damaged items reported within 2 hours qualify for a full FoodGo Wallet credit or bank refund."],t.s)
B.aYr=new A.jA("3. Orders, Pricing & Bakong KHQR Payments","Menu prices are displayed in United States Dollars (USD) with automatic Khmer Riel (KHR) equivalents calculated at the standard platform rate of 1 USD = 4,100 KHR. Supported payment methods include Bakong KHQR (ABA PAY, ACLEDA Mobile, Wing, Sathapana, Canadia, and all NBC Bakong member banks), Credit/Debit Cards, FoodGo Wallet, and Cash on Delivery (COD).",B.aHJ,B.df,B.GK)
B.alC=new A.V(61356,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aYy=new A.jA("4. Delivery & Courier Hand-Off Verification","Estimated delivery times are calculated dynamically based on kitchen preparation load, traffic conditions, and distance. Customers may verify hand-off using the encrypted Delivery Confirmation QR modal.",B.aF,B.df,B.alC)
B.amd=new A.V(63405,"MaterialIcons",null,!1)
B.aYv=new A.jA("5. Governing Law & Dispute Resolution","These Terms are governed by the laws of the Kingdom of Cambodia, including the Law on Electronic Commerce and the Law on Consumer Protection. Any disputes shall be resolved amicably through FoodGo Support (+855 23 999 888) or the competent courts of Phnom Penh.",B.aF,B.df,B.amd)
